            "review_title": "Review at O Bistro",
            "review_text": "Getaway26001074825\n1 contribution\n0\nPerfect Xmas & New year's restaurant ever\nDec 2024 • Business\nI did a spontaneous reservation only a few hours before dinnertime and went for the place at the bar‘s table.\n\nThe staff was very friendly.\n\nI choosed one of the Xmas & New year set‘s and as I said I didn‘t likes the salad from my first course, they offered me something new (I declined thankfully).\n\nEverything else tasted very good and I even had a small talk with bartender, his name Anh. He was interested in my opinion of every course.\n\nI enjoyed my Dinner very much and would come back for another try.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nShould come for dinner\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 5, 2025",
